OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells this evening, before
OL,7,Fheavy rain sweeps across the region
OL,8,Fovernight, accompanied by brisk winds
OL,9,Ffor a time. Remaining mild for late
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA damp start, with
OL,13,Fdifficult travelling conditions in
OL,14,Fplaces. The rain will clear throughout
OL,15,Fthe morning, with sunny spells and
OL,16,Fperhaps the odd shower following.
OL,17,FWinds also easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
